       "text": "About 2,300 residents were evacuated from Brayle, with a further 48 residents evacuated towards the end of the window.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.4",
       "text": "Fallon Coatings deployed in response to the fire and Kellet Road was closed through the estate and at Merrin Canal.",
